@startuml timing
!include _theme.puml
' Event positions are ordinal, not measurements: this is the stale-worker unit-test scenario.
' Q/R/REC are expanded in the key to keep the short event intervals legible.
skinparam timingFontColor #182722
skinparam timingBorderColor #34594D
skinparam timingBackgroundColor #E4EEE7
concise "Embedding run" as R
concise "Work item" as I
concise "Lease owner" as L
scale 1 as 94 pixels
@0
R is Q
I is Q
L is "none"
@1
R is R
I is R
L is A
@2
R is REC
I is Q
L is "none"
@3
R is Q
@4
R is R
I is R
L is B
@5
legend bottom
  <b>Ordinal events, not elapsed time</b>
  Q = queued; R = running; REC = recoverable.
  0 Enqueue · 1 A claims · 2 Reap expired lease and stale run
  3 Admin resumes · 4 B claims · 5 Reject A's stale write
endlegend
@enduml
